# ==============================================================================
# 文件作用：Git 版本控制忽略规则清单 (Git Ignore Specification)
# 生效时机：执行 `git status`、`git add` 与提交时由 Git 自动解析过滤
# 核心职责：
#   1. 彻底隔离 Rust 编译产物、调试符号与测试快照临时文件
#   2. 严格防护敏感环境配置 (.env, production.yaml, secrets.ini) 防泄漏
#   3. 过滤本地 SQLite 数据库、动态上传存储、OS 缓存与各 IDE / AI 辅助工具私有目录
# ==============================================================================

# ── 1. Rust 编译产物与测试临时文件 (Rust & Cargo Build Artifacts) ──────────────
target/
debug/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
**/*.snap.new
cobertura.xml
lcov.info
tarpaulin-report.html

# 锁定并保留 Cargo.lock (确保 Web 应用依赖版本绝对可复现)
!Cargo.lock

# ── 2. 敏感凭据与环境配置文件 (Credentials & Environment Configs) ──────────────
config/local.yaml
config/*.local.yaml
config/production.yaml
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.ini

# ── 3. 本地数据库与动态上传文件 (Databases, Logs & Storages) ───────────────────
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.db
*.db-*
*.log
logs/
tmp/
uploads/
/storages/*/*
!/storages/*/.gitignore
!/storages/*/.gitkeep

# ── 4. 操作系统与本地 IDE 配置 (OS & IDE Tooling) ───────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.mise.local.toml

# ── 5. AI 编程助手与私有记忆库 (AI Agents & Private Contexts) ─────────────────
.agents/skills
.claude/
.gemini/
.codex/
.cursor/
.windsurf/
.opencode/
.continue/
.kiro/
.qoder/
.codebuddy/
.code-review-graph/
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
.mcp.json
skills-lock.json
opencode.jsonc
CODEBUDDY.md
QODER.md
